      <room>H.1301</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>WebKit on ebook readers</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDesktop</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Marco will give a brief introduction on how WebKit GTK works and on how it can be easily embedded in applications.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He will then explain what he did to adapt WebKit to electronic ink displays, reducing the number of refreshes, allowing a book-like page by page view of web pages and showing useful and meaningful placeholders instead of animated content.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2871">Marco Barisione</person>
      </persons>
